  "stem": "<p>If <math alttext=\"StartFraction x Over 8 EndFraction equals 5\"><mrow>\n\t<mrow>\n\t\t<mfrac>\n\t\t\t<mi>x</mi>\n\t\t\t<mn>8</mn>\n\t\t</mfrac>\n\t</mrow>\n\t<mo>=</mo>\n\t<mn>5</mn>\n</mrow>\n</math>, what is the value of <math alttext=\"StartFraction 8 Over x EndFraction\"><mrow>\n\t<mfrac>\n\t\t<mn>8</mn>\n\t\t<mi>x</mi>\n\t</mfrac>\n</mrow>\n</math>?</p>",
